WEBVTT

00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:45.160
--Go, Shoot!

00:01:46.130 --> 00:01:49.680
Chairman Daitenji said he's seen a stone tablet

00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:54.970
similar to the one stolen in America, more than thirty years ago.

00:01:55.550 --> 00:02:02.010
That other stone tablet was stolen by Doctor Zagart,
a former colleague from his days as a scientist.

00:02:05.170 --> 00:02:09.990
In the middle of all of this, Ozma's team
suddenly challenged Takao to a battle.

00:02:10.700 --> 00:02:16.000
A boy named Zeo came in, which
ended the battle before it finished.

00:02:26.880 --> 00:02:29.480
What? Ozma's team did?

00:02:29.480 --> 00:02:30.450
Yes.

00:02:30.740 --> 00:02:33.380
So they've finally
made their move.

00:02:35.160 --> 00:02:39.260
The four of them had a
different feel to them this time.

00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:40.800
I wonder...

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:46.290
They were clear that they're seriously
trying to take our Sacred Beasts.

00:02:46.290 --> 00:02:47.780
Right...

00:02:48.940 --> 00:02:50.450
Takao!

00:02:50.920 --> 00:02:54.550
How can you laugh
at a time like this?

00:02:55.940 --> 00:02:58.210
What's your deal?

00:02:58.910 --> 00:03:03.980
Who cares if they're serious?
We just have to beat them!

00:03:03.980 --> 00:03:05.280
Give it back.

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:11.870
If that Zeo kid hadn't come in,
you might have lost Seiryu!

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:14.130
No way!

00:03:14.130 --> 00:03:16.440
You have no
sense of urgency.

00:03:16.990 --> 00:03:19.510
Who is Zeo?

00:03:19.510 --> 00:03:23.940
He's just a Beyblade fan
who was passing by.

00:03:23.940 --> 00:03:28.690
He isn't used to handling his Beyblade
so as a Blader he's got a ways to go.

00:03:28.690 --> 00:03:31.380
But he's got good instincts.

00:03:38.170 --> 00:03:41.600
And he seemed pretty serious.

00:03:42.600 --> 00:03:47.700
I began Beyblading so I could
become a strong Blader like you.

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:49.220
Really?

00:03:49.650 --> 00:03:53.850
I'm going to a Beyblade
gym called Phoenix.

00:03:54.590 --> 00:03:57.490
Takao Kinomiya.
You're my goal.

00:03:57.490 --> 00:03:58.740
No one but you!

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:01.230
Gross.

00:04:01.230 --> 00:04:02.610
What?

00:04:02.610 --> 00:04:05.250
You say he has good instincts,

00:04:05.250 --> 00:04:09.540
but you're just getting starry-eyed
because he called you his goal.

00:04:09.540 --> 00:04:11.600
That's not it!

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:14.640
Either way, gimme
back my comic book!

00:04:14.640 --> 00:04:15.570
Nope!

00:04:15.570 --> 00:04:16.550
Gimme!

00:04:16.550 --> 00:04:18.150
Not happening!

00:04:22.060 --> 00:04:25.030
Do you have a lead, mom?

00:04:30.320 --> 00:04:36.830
I tried contacting my colleagues
from my days of researching tops...

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:41.380
But as I thought, no one knows
of Zagart's whereabouts.

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:43.150
Is that so...

00:04:43.150 --> 00:04:48.510
If we can't even find him, then we have
no hope of finding the tablet either...

00:04:53.280 --> 00:04:55.640
I made something, but...

00:04:58.620 --> 00:05:00.080
What's that?

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:01.460
The Bit Finder.

00:05:01.460 --> 00:05:03.100
Bit Finder?

00:05:03.310 --> 00:05:07.040
It's a device that can analyze
a Sacred Beast's energy.

00:05:07.040 --> 00:05:11.020
If we use this, it's possible we could find the stone tablet,

00:05:11.020 --> 00:05:13.490
which has the energy of
Sacred Beasts sealed inside it.

00:05:13.490 --> 00:05:16.420
With this? Really?

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:18.660
Don't touch it!

00:05:19.470 --> 00:05:21.520
Thank you, Kyoujyu.

00:05:21.520 --> 00:05:28.080
Don't worry, lady! We're gonna find
that stone tablet, no matter what!

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:29.810
He's right!

00:05:30.310 --> 00:05:31.300
Yes.

00:05:31.300 --> 00:05:34.050
I'm counting on you, kids.

00:05:34.050 --> 00:05:36.890
Yeah! Leave it to us!

00:05:44.440 --> 00:05:47.490
All right, time for us to make our move!

00:05:48.330 --> 00:05:51.360
Huh? What're you all
sitting around for?

00:05:51.360 --> 00:05:54.040
We're not just sitting around.

00:05:54.040 --> 00:05:57.920
We're just not sure about
where we should start from.

00:05:58.050 --> 00:06:04.920
What do you mean? Our priority is finding that
doctor, the Zagart guy or whatever, right?

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:07.660
We know that, obviously!

00:06:08.670 --> 00:06:11.290
The problem is how
to search for him.

00:06:11.290 --> 00:06:12.120
Yeah.

00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:17.840
The chairman couldn't find Doctor Zagart
despite doing everything he could.

00:06:18.580 --> 00:06:19.750
Oh...

00:06:19.750 --> 00:06:21.650
Don't "oh" me!

00:06:44.870 --> 00:06:46.210
Pardon me.

00:06:50.450 --> 00:06:56.510
We've found an optimal Blader fit to use the
Bey with the tablet Sacred Beast within it.

00:07:17.900 --> 00:07:19.820
The Blader's name is Foxy.

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:23.090
We're ready over here.

00:07:23.730 --> 00:07:25.040
Roger that.

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:26.500
You may enter.

00:07:41.730 --> 00:07:42.890
Ready yourselves!

00:07:50.890 --> 00:07:53.810
Three! Two! One!

00:07:53.810 --> 00:07:56.030
--Go, Shoot!

00:08:02.820 --> 00:08:03.900
There!

00:08:17.200 --> 00:08:18.810
Why you...

00:08:36.140 --> 00:08:39.930
He's the only one fit
to use that Beyblade.

00:08:39.930 --> 00:08:41.120
Yes.

00:08:49.370 --> 00:08:50.460
There it is!

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:52.020
Lemme see!

00:08:52.020 --> 00:08:54.930
Data on Doctor Zagart...

00:08:55.550 --> 00:08:56.850
Zero results.

00:08:57.500 --> 00:08:58.720
Come on...

00:08:58.720 --> 00:09:00.190
No good, huh?

00:09:00.190 --> 00:09:03.190
Jeez, your laptop is worthless.

00:09:03.190 --> 00:09:05.520
It's not my laptop's fault!

00:09:11.600 --> 00:09:14.490
And now you made him mad.

00:09:18.990 --> 00:09:20.080
Zeo...

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:23.050
What're you all the
way out here for?

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:25.800
I came to ask a favor.

00:09:25.800 --> 00:09:27.240
A favor?

00:09:27.240 --> 00:09:29.000
Come with me!

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:31.810
You can't just tell me to come with--

00:09:31.810 --> 00:09:34.590
Hey! Where are we going?

00:09:37.680 --> 00:09:40.800
So this is the gym you're going to?

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:43.060
Pretty cool!

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:45.300
Yeah. Everyone's hard at work.

00:09:45.300 --> 00:09:46.520
Okay!

00:09:56.210 --> 00:09:59.600
Look at 'em go...
Let me go a round, too!

00:10:06.100 --> 00:10:07.960
Thank you, thank you!

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:12.790
You really are Takao Kinomiya's friend!

00:10:12.790 --> 00:10:14.410
I told you so!

00:10:14.410 --> 00:10:17.260
Sorry for not believing you, Zeo.

00:10:17.260 --> 00:10:19.710
As long as you understand now.

00:10:19.950 --> 00:10:25.440
You dragged me all the way out
here just to prove that we're friends?

00:10:25.610 --> 00:10:26.870
Yeah.

00:10:27.170 --> 00:10:34.670
If you're friends, does that mean you're getting
all kinds of advice from the world champion?

00:10:35.850 --> 00:10:37.560
Not yet.

00:10:37.560 --> 00:10:39.990
He's going to give
me advice soon!

00:10:52.900 --> 00:10:56.400
Can't you just teach
me a move or two?

00:10:57.420 --> 00:10:58.190
No.

00:10:58.190 --> 00:10:59.190
Why?

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:03.760
I'm kind of disappointed.

00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:07.650
Takao Kinomiya's a bigger
cheapskate than I thought.

00:11:07.650 --> 00:11:09.690
I've been thinking it over.

00:11:09.980 --> 00:11:12.830
Beyblade moves aren't
something taught to you.

00:11:12.830 --> 00:11:15.920
You have to learn them yourself.

00:11:17.250 --> 00:11:20.240
That way's more fun, right?

00:11:20.930 --> 00:11:24.000
And I know you
have it in you.

00:11:24.830 --> 00:11:28.800
You're going to be a
great Blader one day.

00:11:29.920 --> 00:11:31.400
Understood.

00:11:34.160 --> 00:11:35.800
That reminds me...

00:11:36.080 --> 00:11:38.800
Was that Rei Kon
in the dojo with you?

00:11:39.030 --> 00:11:39.980
Yeah.

00:11:39.980 --> 00:11:41.860
I knew it!

00:11:41.860 --> 00:11:44.710
Kai and Max are in Japan, too.

00:11:46.280 --> 00:11:48.960
Could you introduce them to me?

00:11:48.960 --> 00:11:51.530
Sure. Come with me.

00:11:57.030 --> 00:11:59.220
We don't have
any options left...

00:11:59.220 --> 00:11:59.940
Yeah...

00:12:04.530 --> 00:12:14.460
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade 2002"

00:12:30.270 --> 00:12:31.940
Who are you?!

00:12:36.050 --> 00:12:38.430
At least tell us your name!

00:12:38.620 --> 00:12:40.730
My name doesn't matter.

00:12:40.730 --> 00:12:43.860
I just came to take
your Sacred Beasts.

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:45.650
What?!

00:12:45.650 --> 00:12:47.890
We don't have
to bother with him.

00:12:47.890 --> 00:12:49.140
She's right.

00:12:50.960 --> 00:12:54.780
Rei Kon! Are you going
to battle me, or not?!

00:12:54.780 --> 00:12:56.240
Which is it?!

00:12:56.240 --> 00:12:59.000
I can't afford to run
if you know my name.

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:00.210
I accept!

00:13:00.210 --> 00:13:01.080
--Rei!

00:13:01.080 --> 00:13:02.530
Don't worry.

00:13:03.080 --> 00:13:05.150
Then follow me!

00:13:05.990 --> 00:13:07.190
Wait!

00:13:09.480 --> 00:13:11.340
Doesn't look like
we can stop them!

00:13:34.090 --> 00:13:35.260
Rei...

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:39.900
Before we fight, I have
a question to ask you.

00:13:43.440 --> 00:13:45.960
Are you with
Ozma and his team?

00:13:45.960 --> 00:13:51.400
Or part of the group that stole
Judy's stone tablet in America?

00:13:51.400 --> 00:13:52.680
Which is it?

00:13:56.690 --> 00:13:59.010
It was pointless to ask.

00:14:02.860 --> 00:14:08.340
Doctor Zagart. I believe Foxy will
perform as per your expectations.

00:14:10.340 --> 00:14:12.620
Crush him to bits, Foxy.

00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:20.750
Three! Two! One!

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:23.240
--Go, Shoot!

00:14:35.990 --> 00:14:37.460
Driger!

00:14:45.090 --> 00:14:46.280
Yes!

00:14:50.610 --> 00:14:52.410
Keep it up, Rei!

00:14:58.230 --> 00:15:01.430
His confidence worries me...

00:15:01.430 --> 00:15:03.410
Who is he fighting?

00:15:04.420 --> 00:15:06.640
I'm not quite sure, myself...

00:15:07.250 --> 00:15:11.260
Hey, guys! I'm here to
introduce my new friend!

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:15.040
Where'd they go?

00:15:15.040 --> 00:15:16.270
Look at that.

00:15:17.880 --> 00:15:19.170
What?

00:15:23.440 --> 00:15:25.040
What happened?

00:15:32.550 --> 00:15:34.130
Now!!

00:15:40.660 --> 00:15:43.040
Yes! That's it, Foxy!

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:50.000
His Bey specializes in
attacking from above!

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:54.700
Rei!

00:15:54.700 --> 00:15:57.470
It's really Rei Kon!

00:15:57.470 --> 00:15:59.490
Dang, what's going on?

00:16:02.580 --> 00:16:06.660
Leaving me behind for a battle...

00:16:06.660 --> 00:16:07.930
Takao!

00:16:07.930 --> 00:16:09.660
Kai Hiwatari!

00:16:10.820 --> 00:16:14.600
Jeez, that guy's wiping
the floor with Rei!

00:16:14.600 --> 00:16:16.470
Don't say it so casually!

00:16:16.470 --> 00:16:19.000
His opponent is after
the four Sacred Beasts!

00:16:19.000 --> 00:16:20.010
What?!

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:26.820
Hurry up and summon
your Sacred Beast.

00:16:26.820 --> 00:16:30.140
I don't need it to beat you.

00:16:30.320 --> 00:16:32.410
Then I'll make you summon it.

00:16:32.410 --> 00:16:35.400
Rise, my Sacred Beast!

00:16:48.530 --> 00:16:50.180
A Sacred Beast!

00:16:50.180 --> 00:16:51.650
Could it be?!

00:16:58.350 --> 00:17:00.990
Beat him now, Foxy!

00:17:07.390 --> 00:17:08.760
Darn!

00:17:08.970 --> 00:17:11.510
Come on out, Byakko!

00:17:21.740 --> 00:17:22.530
Yes!

00:17:22.530 --> 00:17:24.340
You can do it, Rei!

00:17:48.520 --> 00:17:49.580
What?!

00:18:16.960 --> 00:18:18.740
What's going on?

00:18:19.160 --> 00:18:20.600
Which one is the real one?

00:18:20.600 --> 00:18:22.340
I'm looking into it!

00:18:25.120 --> 00:18:27.080
I can't tell!

00:19:12.030 --> 00:19:14.390
Which is the real one?

00:19:21.700 --> 00:19:22.800
The wind!

00:19:24.040 --> 00:19:26.780
Stop the wind!
The enemy is hidden in there!

00:19:26.780 --> 00:19:28.020
That's it!

00:19:28.020 --> 00:19:31.200
Go, Driger!!

00:19:51.680 --> 00:19:53.040
Found you!

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:56.000
Finish him off, Driger!

00:20:50.980 --> 00:20:52.890
That's their power...

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:56.240
We cannot underestimate them.

00:20:56.500 --> 00:20:59.190
Yay! He won!

00:20:59.410 --> 00:21:01.410
How did he have a Sacred Beast?

00:21:01.790 --> 00:21:06.610
There are Bladers other than us and Ozma's
team who can summon Sacred Beasts.

00:21:06.610 --> 00:21:10.770
What if that Sacred Beast
was from the tablet?

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:12.260
No way!

00:21:18.680 --> 00:21:20.840
That was definitely a Sacred Beast.

00:21:20.840 --> 00:21:25.030
How?! How is there
a Sacred Beast here?!

00:21:25.030 --> 00:21:28.980
Just where did that
Sacred Beast come from?

00:23:00.900 --> 00:23:05.090
Takao's on the verge of losing it with all these enemies coming after them.

00:23:05.090 --> 00:23:09.680
Zeo appears before him when he forgets what's important.

00:23:10.470 --> 00:23:13.590
By the way, Chairman,
are you the forgetful type?

00:23:13.590 --> 00:23:15.250
Huh? "I don't have glasses"?

00:23:15.250 --> 00:23:17.730
You've got them!
Right on your nose!

00:23:17.730 --> 00:23:21.690
The next episode will be great, too! So don't forget to watch it!
